WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.176
Video 22. Backup, daily backup ane restore.

00:00:05.376 --> 00:00:10.796
Tamara chopda tamara PC par chhe. Hisaab eni
copy raakhe chhe.

00:00:10.726 --> 00:00:15.071
Darroj, Hisaab darek company no backup jaate
le chhe.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.893
Hisaab Drive ek encrypted copy aa PC ni bahaar
muke chhe.

00:00:19.824 --> 00:00:23.925
Backup thi tame company game tyaare restore
karo chho.

00:00:24.225 --> 00:00:27.762
Gateway par company no chhello backup dekhaay
chhe.

00:00:28.725 --> 00:00:35.517
Alt+Y thi Data menu khule chhe. Pachhi Enter
thi Backup & Restore.

00:00:35.547 --> 00:00:39.865
B etle Backup. Company pehle thi select chhe.

00:00:39.895 --> 00:00:46.897
Ctrl+A, pachhi Enter, ane backup tarat levaay
chhe. Navi file list ma chhe.

00:00:47.977 --> 00:00:56.596
L thi Daily Backup khule chhe. E pehla divas thi chaalu
chhe: darroj 13:00 vaagye, 7 versions saathe.

00:00:56.626 --> 00:01:01.838
E samaye PC bandh hoy, to backup pachhini
sharuaate thaay chhe.

00:01:01.868 --> 00:01:09.674
F10 thi darek backup file dekhaay chhe. Daily
backup ni file na naam ma Daily lakhelu chhe.

00:01:10.754 --> 00:01:18.097
PC bagde ke khovaay, to ena parni copy pan
jaay chhe. F9 bahaar copy gothve chhe.

00:01:18.127 --> 00:01:26.166
Google Drive ke OneDrive: ek vaar sign in
karo. Ke pachhi folder, jem ke USB disk.

00:01:26.196 --> 00:01:33.655
Pachhi backup password. Copy aa PC maathi jaay
e pehla Hisaab ene encrypt kare chhe.

00:01:33.685 --> 00:01:39.757
Recovery key lakhi raakho. Password bhuli
jaao, to e copy khole chhe.

00:01:41.485 --> 00:01:48.506
Have company ni ek copy aa PC ni bahaar chhe.
Darroj tya navi copy jaay chhe.

00:01:50.335 --> 00:01:56.414
R thi backup restore thaay chhe. File pasand
karo, ane Enter dabaavo.

00:01:56.444 --> 00:02:04.878
Aa company haji ahi chhe. Etle Hisaab ene nava number
saathe navi company tarike restore kare chhe.

00:02:04.908 --> 00:02:09.928
Yes thi e load thaay chhe. Have banne company
khulli chhe.

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:15.864
Darroj backup lo, ane ek copy aa PC ni bahaar
raakho.

00:02:15.794 --> 00:02:19.896
Have pachhi: users, passwords ane Edit Log.

